      "content": "The emptiness you feel is the echo of an immense loss, and it is a valid, heavy thing to carry. But your worth is not defined by the kingdom's existence or the next chapter of its tale. Dignity is not found in a final surrender, but in the raw courage it takes to keep facing the void, even when you feel nothing. Please, let that courage be focused on letting someone else share the burden of this ending, for you do not have to face the quiet alone.",
